WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.326 --> 00:00:02.040
My mom is 78 years old.

2
00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:05.850
She has advanced Parkinson's
and dementia,

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.375
and lives in assisted living.

4
00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.492
Over the last few years,
the phone has turned into

5
00:00:12.493 --> 00:00:13.958
something she can't really use.

6
00:00:14.859 --> 00:00:17.170
Her hands have become
slow and stiff.

7
00:00:17.997 --> 00:00:20.200
She forgets where her phone is,

8
00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.400
and more often than not,

9
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.918
it's not even charged.

10
00:00:24.841 --> 00:00:27.174
So people call,
but they can't reach her.
